<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Git - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/tags/git/</link><description>Git - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 24 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kentxxq.com/tags/git/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>git</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/git/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/git/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><code>git</code> 是一个代码管理工具.</p>
